{
  "answer": "**答案:South Orange Little League**(在佛罗里达州奥兰多地区)。Damon 上初中(Walker Jr. High)之前在这个联盟打球。\n\n有一点需要注意:UPI 的页面写的是 \"Dr. Phillips Little League\"。我搜了两次,没有找到能解释这个差异的资料。South Orange 出现在更多来源里,所以我选它。\n\nSources:\n- [Johnny Damon – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johnny_Damon)\n- [UPI – Johnny Damon](https://www.upi.com/topic/Johnny_Damon/news/1/)\n- [Alchetron – Johnny Damon](https://alchetron.com/Johnny-Damon)",
